# Oldest glibc the Linux archive must run on (#389): Ubuntu 22.04, Debian 12.
# Read by scripts/glibc-floor.sh and scripts/glibc-floor-test.sh. The CI job
# `release-linux` builds on the machine of this glibc (runner `ubuntu-22.04`):
# change both together, and the manual (getting-started/installation.md).
GLIBC_FLOOR=2.35
